{"product":{"id":10065157030176,"title":"Mazza Trail","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Trail mastery for your bike.\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen your trail choice is more technical than NASA, enter Mazza Trail. Built for riders who demand confident cornering and reliable traction across varied and technical terrain. \"\"Houston, we've got this.\"\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProgressive siping balances control and stability, while ramped leading edges provide climbing traction on rollers and technical sections. Wide spacing between knobs ensures self-cleaning performance, shedding loose soil and sticky mud so the tread stays ready for the next challenge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVittoria’s 4Compound Formulation strategically places four optimized rubber compounds exactly where they’re needed, delivering a harmonious blend of speed, grip, and durability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Trail casing brings it all together with a tubeless-ready nylon construction, reinforced sidewalls, and an anti-puncture belt—light for long rides, strong for the roughest trails.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"MTB Tire","created_at":"2025-10-02T21:14:01-05:00","handle":"mazza-trail","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:08:38-05:00","published_at":"2025-11-18T09:05:49-06:00","template_suffix":"xc-trail-template","published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, Enduro\/Trail, EP70, IPP40, MTB, Sitewide, Tires, Trail Case","variants":[{"id":50758678380832,"product_id":10065157030176,"title":"27.5x2.6 \/ Black","price":"96.99","sku":"11A00779","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"27.5x2.6","option2":"Black","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-10-02T21:14:01-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:08:38-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"8022530036313","grams":1100,"image_id":50972750381344,"weight":1100.0,"weight_unit":"g","tax_code":"","requires_shippin